	(text "Pawl: 1 BTN8982TA used as a\nhigh-side switch (single direction; actuator - grounds at the motor).  IN=1 drives OUT to VS.\nBTN8982 VS abs max 40 V -> SMCJ22A on the motor feed (Vc ~35.5 V).  No reverse protection on the\nmotor feeds: reverse battery conducts through the body diodes -> the EXTERNAL fuse must blow.\nIS -> 1k sense resistor -> ADC1 (PAWL_IS).\nBulk: 220uF 35V on PAWL_12V.  Pawl stall current: TBD (measure)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 15 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "04dff038-0553-5f8d-9712-8fc44389fce7")
	)
